 left  me feeling more alone than ever it was  the lowest point in my life but it was  also my wake-up call because it was the  first time that I really felt like  loneliness many artists put their  feelings into the art there are endless  books movies paintings musics all filled  with a real emotion of an artist so as  an artist myself I did the same  I shared my feelings I wanted to help  people cope with loneliness I wanted ya  to make some understand that to really  experience it through my art in a form  of an interactive story a video game so  in our game we called it sea of solitude  you are a person named Kay who is  suffering from such strong loneliness  that her inner feeling the anger feeling  of hopelessness worthlessness turned to  the outside and she becomes a monster  the game well Kay is actually a  representation of me and the past I went  through to overcome my struggles  the game plays actually in case mine so  you walk through a word that is flooded  by her tears and the weather changing by  her mood how the mood is changing of her  and well the only thing he wears the  only thing is her backpack  it's a baggage we all carry throughout  our life and Kay doesn't know how to  cope with her emotions in the right way  so her backpack becomes bigger and  bigger until it bursts and she finally  is forced to overcome her own struggles  so in our story we present many  different manifestations of loneliness  loneliness through social exclusion is  very common in our game the brazza of k  get bullied in his school and he just  wants to hide and fly away and we  portray him as a huge bird monster  surrounded by thick fog the player has  to actually walk through his school and  experience the really feels harm that  the brother had been through because for  a long time nobody really listens to him  but the very moments like friends and  family start to listen the first step  towards overcoming this form of  loneliness had been made we also show  loneliness 