ot really  embrace or touch it's always something  in the distance we've hurt rape joy as a  child version of K like with a yellow  raincoat so she is invertible to the  ocean of tears but joy can also turn  into obsession and start to be actually  harmful for k like when she start  obsessing over her boyfriend joy will  not turn back to normal antic he is  realizing that her happiness should not  depend on anybody else but herself  so our monsters appear you turn scary  but if you overcome your reluctance and  approach them you soon see that they are  no monsters at all but just fragile  beings that are simply overwhelmed by  what life throws at them all of those  emotions be it saved out or even safe  distraction don't completely vanish in  our game the key message is to not only  chase for joy or happiness but to  embrace all your emotions and bringing  them into balance being okay with  sometimes not being okay so everyone had  its own loneliness story to tell the  serialization changed everything for me  like being much more open with my  emotions and concentrating much more on  to my private life my friends my family  when we released the game like literally  thousands of fans wrote us all sharing  the stories with us and telling us said  they felt not so alone anymore just  because he played our game now many  people brought assets they felt hope for  a better future for themself for the  first time indicates many broad asset  they seek therapy now just because  active help yeah just because he  our game and fell hopeful to overcome  their own struggles our game is not a  therapy it's not meant to be a therapy  it's just my friends and me sharing our  stories through our video games but we  are so deeply thankful for every single  message that people feel better just  because we shared our story with them so  I I don't completely overcame my urge to  help others but I don't want to overcome  it anymore I love it I just needed to  bring it to a healthy size so it doesn't  stand in the way of deeper relationships  anymore but even helped me to connect  with people so if you have an inner  monster that is born out of negative  emotions it is not only the goal to kill  that monster but to understand that we  humans are complex beings look at what  part of your life is so big that others  fall short look at what emotion you  barely feel or maybe feel too much and  move towards lowering those Peaks most  of all it's about understanding that all  the wide range of emotions and struggles  makes us what we are humans thank you  [Applause]
 

